  "title": "v1_145 / October 26, 2026",
  "category": "RELEASE_NOTES",
  "intent": "release_notes",
  "content": "## October 26, 2026\n\n* Open sessions in an editor instead of the **Chat** view by enabling the experimental `setting(chat.agentSessions.openInEditor)` setting. _[microsoft/vscode#336136: Allow configuring the default click action for Chat Sessions](https://github.com/microsoft/vscode/issues/336136)_\n\n\n* Show size estimates faster for unchanged idle sessions when reopening or refreshing **Worktree Cleanup** in the Agents window. _[microsoft/vscode#344370: Persist session worktree sizes for Worktree Cleanup](https://github.com/microsoft/vscode/issues/344370)_\n\n---\n\nWe really appreciate people trying our new features as soon as they are ready, so check back here often and learn what's new.\n\n<a id=\"scroll-to-top\" role=\"button\" title=\"Scroll to top\" aria-label=\"scroll to top\" href=\"#\"><span class=\"icon\"></span></a>\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"css/inproduct_releasenotes.css\"/>\n\n<!-- Closed feature-request query snapshot\n{\n  \"repository\": \"microsoft/vscode\",\n  \"milestone\": \"1.145.0\",\n  \"label\": \"feature-request\",\n  \"closedSince\": \"2026-10-28\",\n  \"checkedThrough\": \"2026-11-02\",\n  \"publicInsidersCommit\": \"67710841ad061a9e253214f87bf5415a185ab2ff\",\n  \"issues\": [\n    {\"number\":344588,\"title\":\"Improve bulk worktree cleanup progress and recovery\",\"closedAt\":\"2026-10-28T00:13:15Z\",\"stateReason\":\"COMPLETED\"},\n    {\"number\":344703,\"title\":\"Markdown editor: hide whitespace indicators by default (markdown.editor.renderWhitespace)\",\"closedAt\":\"2026-10-28T09:22:28Z\",\"stateReason\":\"COMPLETED\"},\n    {\"number\":243940,\"title\":\"MCP: Customize descriptions for server/tools via mcp.json\",\"closedAt\":\"2026-10-28T14:43:44Z\",\"stateReason\":\"COMPLETED\"},\n    {\"number\":338336,\"title\":\"MCP Apps: App-provided tools registered via App.registerTool() are not exposed to Copilot agent\",\"closedAt\":\"2026-10-28T15:48:34Z\",\"stateReason\":\"COMPLETED\"},\n    {\"number\":344755,\"title\":\"Add a setting to show breadcrumbs for untitled files, off by default\",\"closedAt\":\"2026-10-28T17:04:47Z\",\"stateReason\":\"COMPLETED\"},\n    {\"number\":344781,\"title\":\"Add a built-in skill to record demo videos of web pages\",\"closedAt\":\"2026-10-28T17:33:31Z\",\"stateReason\":\"COMPLETED\"},\n    {\"number\":344779,\"title\":\"Allow Worktree Cleanup to manage worktrees without a listed session\",\"closedAt\":\"2026-10-28T19:03:07Z\",\"stateReason\":\"COMPLETED\"},\n    {\"number\":342213,\"title\":\"Allow disabling Copilot's Co-authored-by trailer in agent-host sessions\",\"closedAt\":\"2026-10-29T01:21:55Z\",\"stateReason\":\"COMPLETED\"},\n    {\"number\":247375,\"title\":\"Add MCP Allow List to MDM Policy\",\"closedAt\":\"2026-10-29T04:43:12Z\",\"stateReason\":\"COMPLETED\"},\n    {\"number\":341954,\"title\":\"Improve editor tab scrollbar placement\",\"closedAt\":\"2026-10-30T00:17:24Z\",\"stateReason\":\"COMPLETED\"},\n    {\"number\":178766,\"title\":\"VSCode does not highlight all matches of the highlighted text\",\"closedAt\":\"2026-10-30T09:19:47Z\",\"stateReason\":\"DUPLICATE\"},\n    {\"number\":131078,\"title\":\"Show bracket in ruler\",\"closedAt\":\"2026-10-30T09:21:58Z\",\"stateReason\":\"DUPLICATE\"},\n    {\"number\":177400,\"title\":\"selecting text highlights match only if the length is less than or equal to 200\",\"closedAt\":\"2026-10-30T09:45:20Z\",\"stateReason\":\"COMPLETED\"},\n    {\"number\":261241,\"title\":\"Accessibility Issue: \\\"Tokenization is skipped...\\\"\",\"closedAt\":\"2026-10-30T09:45:27Z\",\"stateReason\":\"COMPLETED\"},\n    {\"number\":304043,\"title\":\"Artifacts tool - have inline action to save the artifact\",\"closedAt\":\"2026-10-30T09:45:57Z\",\"stateReason\":\"COMPLETED\"},\n    {\"number\":235765,\"title\":\"Missing support for asymmetric visibility when using PHP constructor property promotion\",\"closedAt\":\"2026-10-30T09:46:04Z\",\"stateReason\":\"COMPLETED\"},\n    {\"number\":165024,\"title\":\"Keybindings for side-by-side diff editor arrow functions\",\"closedAt\":\"2026-10-30T09:46:20Z\",\"stateReason\":\"COMPLETED\"},\n    {\"number\":147888,\"title\":\"Prevent the blue warning strip at the top that keeps popping up\",\"closedAt\":\"2026-10-30T09:46:56Z\",\"stateReason\":\"DUPLICATE\"},\n    {\"number\":199316,\"title\":\"Multi-editor diff: Hard to collapse/expand file\",\"closedAt\":\"2026-10-30T09:47:06Z\",\"stateReason\":\"COMPLETED\"},\n    {\"number\":199293,\"title\":\"Allow to click on the file name to expand\",\"closedAt\":\"2026-10-30T09:47:14Z\",\"stateReason\":\"COMPLETED\"},\n    {\"number\":164029,\"title\":\"Inline completions and snippets collide\",\"closedAt\":\"2026-10-30T09:47:59Z\",\"stateReason\":\"COMPLETED\"},\n    {\"number\":207519,\"title\":\"Multi Diff doesn't seem to have Inline View toggle\",\"closedAt\":\"2026-10-30T09:48:02Z\",\"stateReason\":\"COMPLETED\"},\n    {\"number\":242475,\"title\":\"Merge Editor does not recognize ActiveEditorWriteableInSession setting until reopened\",\"closedAt\":\"2026-10-30T09:48:30Z\",\"stateReason\":\"COMPLETED\"},\n    {\"number\":235883,\"title\":\"tab is not aligned for 2 bytes languages like Korean, Chinese, Japanese\",\"closedAt\":\"2026-10-30T09:50:08Z\",\"stateReason\":\"COMPLETED\"},\n    {\"number\":136646,\"title\":\"Feature request: Option to colorize only active bracket pairs\",\"closedAt\":\"2026-10-30T09:52:01Z\",\"stateReason\":\"COMPLETED\"},\n    {\"number\":204317,\"title\":\"Unable to expand an entry in the multi diff editor when clicking on header\",\"closedAt\":\"2026-10-30T09:52:07Z\",\"stateReason\":\"COMPLETED\"},\n    {\"number\":84297,\"title\":\"API support for Timeline view\",\"closedAt\":\"2026-10-30T15:09:55Z\",\"stateReason\":\"COMPLETED\"},\n    {\"number\":869,\"title\":\"Exclude all files except for...\",\"closedAt\":\"2026-10-30T16:32:58Z\",\"stateReason\":\"COMPLETED\"},\n    {\"number\":330524,\"title\":\"Add corner rounding to dictation and voice mode buttons focus outline\",\"closedAt\":\"2026-10-30T18:40:13Z\",\"stateReason\":\"COMPLETED\"},\n    {\"number\":345254,\"title\":\"Agents window is usable without GitHub sign-in by default\",\"closedAt\":\"2026-10-30T19:13:36Z\",\"stateReason\":\"COMPLETED\"},\n    {\"number\":344632,\"title\":\"Sessions Inbox: prioritized, actionable agent notifications\",\"closedAt\":\"2026-10-30T20:13:48Z\",\"stateReason\":\"COMPLETED\"},\n    {\"number\":343622,\"title\":\"Agents Window: support Compare Agents in local and empty Git repositories\",\"closedAt\":\"2026-10-30T20:20:10Z\",\"stateReason\":\"COMPLETED\"},\n    {\"number\":342637,\"title\":\"[Worktree Cleanup] Clicking on a session removed it from the list\",\"closedAt\":\"2026-10-31T09:14:20Z\",\"stateReason\":\"COMPLETED\"},\n    {\"number\":343910,\"title\":\"Why can't I nest a Claude/Codex session under a Copilot session?\",\"closedAt\":\"2026-11-02T10:15:58Z\",\"stateReason\":\"COMPLETED\"}\n  ]\n}\n-->",
